  "description": "PDF ingestion for .NET RAG/LLM pipelines. Token-aware, structure-aware chunking (7 profiles), element-aware semantic splitting, and native (Rust) text extraction with page numbers and bounding boxes for citations — ready for Semantic Kernel / Kernel Memory and vector-store ingestion. MIT-licensed and memory-safe. Also supports PDF creation and manipulation (merge, split, rotate, page extraction).",
